{
	"components": [
		{
			"id": "chat_1",
			"provider": "chat",
			"name": "Advisor chat",
			"config": {
				"hideForm": true,
				"mode": "Source",
				"parameters": {},
				"type": "chat"
			},
			"ui": {
				"position": {
					"x": 20,
					"y": 200
				},
				"measured": {
					"width": 150,
					"height": 66
				},
				"nodeType": "default",
				"formDataValid": true
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "agent_rocketride_1",
			"provider": "agent_rocketride",
			"name": "Margin advisor (read-only)",
			"config": {
				"agent_description": "Answers questions about AI spend and margin per customer by reading live keys from Redis. Read-only.",
				"instructions": [
					"You answer questions about AI cost, budgets and margin for a SaaS company's customers. All facts live in Redis. Read them with the Redis tools before answering; never answer from memory or guess a number.",
					"ALWAYS start with exactly one call: redis_get with key 'rollup:current'. It is a JSON snapshot the app refreshes continuously, holding the month and, for every customer: id, name, plan, revenue_usd, budget_usd, cost_usd, budget_used_pct, margin_pct, per-feature cost_usd and calls, switched_off features and the fallback model. It answers almost every question, so answer straight after reading it. Do not scan first.",
					"Only if the rollup is missing or lacks what was asked, read individual keys. Logical key names (the namespace is added for you; MONTH is YYYY-MM): 'budget:CUSTOMER' JSON with name, plan, revenue_usd, budget_usd. 'usage:CUSTOMER:FEATURE:MONTH' AI cost counter in micro-dollars (divide by 1,000,000). 'calls:CUSTOMER:FEATURE:MONTH' number of AI calls. 'switch:CUSTOMER:FEATURE' exists with value 'off' while a feature is switched off; its ttl_seconds says when it turns back on. 'fallback:CUSTOMER' cheaper model in force. 'pending:ID' a proposed change waiting for approval. Use redis_scan (cursor '0', repeat with the returned cursor until done is true) to list keys, and issue independent reads together.",
					"Your Redis connection is read-only. You cannot change budgets, switches or fallbacks and must not try. When asked for a change, still read 'rollup:current' first, then reply with the current state of that customer and say the change has to be proposed on the customer's page so a person can approve it.",
					"Answer briefly in Markdown: lead with the direct answer in one or two sentences, name the month, and add a small table only when comparing more than two customers. Copy every number exactly as it appears in the data, with dollar amounts to two decimals; state each figure once."
				],
				"max_waves": 6,
				"require_tool_call": true,
				"parameters": {}
			},
			"input": [
				{
					"lane": "questions",
					"from": "chat_1"
				}
			],
			"ui": {
				"position": {
					"x": 240,
					"y": 200
				},
				"measured": {
					"width": 150,
					"height": 86
				},
				"nodeType": "default",
				"formDataValid": true
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "llm_gemini_1",
			"provider": "llm_gemini",
			"name": "Gemini",
			"config": {
				"profile": "custom",
				"model": "models/gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
				"apikey": "${ROCKETRIDE_GEMINI_KEY}",
				"modelTotalTokens": 1048576,
				"modelOutputTokens": 8192,
				"temperature": 0
			},
			"control": [
				{
					"classType": "llm",
					"from": "agent_rocketride_1"
				}
			],
			"ui": {
				"position": {
					"x": 60,
					"y": 380
				},
				"measured": {
					"width": 150,
					"height": 66
				},
				"nodeType": "default",
				"formDataValid": true
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "memory_internal_1",
			"provider": "memory_internal",
			"name": "Memory (Internal)",
			"config": {
				"type": "memory_internal"
			},
			"control": [
				{
					"classType": "memory",
					"from": "agent_rocketride_1"
				}
			],
			"ui": {
				"position": {
					"x": 240,
					"y": 380
				},
				"measured": {
					"width": 150,
					"height": 40
				},
				"nodeType": "default",
				"formDataValid": true
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "redis_readonly_1",
			"provider": "tool_redis",
			"name": "Redis (read-only)",
			"config": {
				"host": "127.0.0.1",
				"port": 6379,
				"key_prefix": "rr:margin-guard:",
				"allow_writes": false
			},
			"control": [
				{
					"classType": "tool",
					"from": "agent_rocketride_1"
				}
			],
			"ui": {
				"position": {
					"x": 420,
					"y": 380
				},
				"measured": {
					"width": 150,
					"height": 40
				},
				"nodeType": "default",
				"formDataValid": true
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "response_answers_1",
			"provider": "response_answers",
			"config": {
				"laneName": "answers"
			},
			"input": [
				{
					"lane": "answers",
					"from": "agent_rocketride_1"
				}
			],
			"ui": {
				"position": {
					"x": 460,
					"y": 200
				},
				"measured": {
					"width": 150,
					"height": 66
				},
				"nodeType": "default",
				"formDataValid": true
			}
		}
	],
	"project_id": "f5a5ed0d-547f-4c88-b8e5-a3d13b874b35",
	"viewport": {
		"x": 0,
		"y": 0,
		"zoom": 1
	},
	"version": 1
}
